      "mapper": 0,
      "romSha256": "a6131a45fe5ec5f8e5778abfcd2031477231a023f30af8533c6d25acf8297a43",
      "notes": "The default make target is 'run' (it launches fceux/Mesen), so the pipeline must ask for 'all'. tools/donut.py calls os.get_terminal_size(), which needs a controlling terminal, hence usePty."
    },
    {
