      "romSha256": "ee51cd9562f28195ba015d9857c6c4fc9bf67cdfb213e95f655e586b92195173",
      "notes": "Builds thwaite.nes (NROM-256) and thwaite128.nes (NROM-128); the pipeline ships the 256 variant. This is the only bundled project that genuinely needs a C compiler (tools/dte.c -> tools/dte)."
